        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "White linen.  The background is solidly embroidered with red silk.  The design of conventional, symmetrical forms arranged vertically and connected by obliquely arranged irregular bands giving the effect of an undulating line, is of white linen detailed with red silk.  Patched with red damask.  Very similar to 93.202."@en ;
